=== Claim 1: generateToken() signature vs. what express.js actually passes ===
Real call site in server/express.js:
  const sToken = sessionToken.generateToken(cdapConfig, log, authToken);
Real function signature in server/token.mjs:
  export function generateToken(cdapConfig, logger = console) { ... }
-> the 3rd argument (authToken, i.e. the caller's own credential) has no parameter to bind to.

